 documented decisions.","The creator publishes the prompt, Claude Code session, generated textures, and build notes. Claude implemented the game and tested it; the author reviews its strengths and gameplay limitations.",[1245],"gpt-image-2",[1245],[1239,1240,1241,1242],{"_51":1236,"_26":1237,"_18":831},{"_51":1232,"_26":1215,"_18":307,"_207":1233},{"_51":880,"_26":1228,"_259":260,"_207":1229},{"_51":1223,"_26":1224,"_207":1225},[541,117,905],"example:moonlight-mayhem-codex","moonlight-mayhem-codex","Moonlight & Mayhem","A 3D museum heist made with Codex: rescue two raccoon crewmates, evade security, stack the crew, and steal the Golden Sardine.","/examples/moonlight-mayhem-codex/",{"_20":1254,"_22":1255,"_24":1256,"_107":322,"_1106":1318,"_89":112,"_246":251,"_243":1316,"_9":1319,"_228":1320,"_19":1321,"_33":1322,"_204":1323,"_197":1324},[1260,1261,1262,1263,1264,1265,1266,1267,1268,1269,1270,1271,1272,1273,1274,1275,1276,1277,1278,1279],{"_49":22,"_53":1255,"_55":22,"_57":-7},{"_49":111,"_53":1256,"_55":24,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":248,"_53":322,"_55":107,"_57":58},{"_49":190,"_51":1103,"_234":1104,"_61":1317,"_55":1106,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":87,"_53":88,"_55":89,"_57":90},{"_49":50,"_51":244,"_53":245,"_55":246,"_57":86},{"_49":50,"_51":241,"_53":1316,"_55":243,"_57":58},{"_49":190,"_51":233,"_234":235,"_61":1311,"_55":9,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":229,"_61":1307,"_55":228,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":226,"_53":812,"_55":228,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":224,"_53":312,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":218,"_61":1303,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":216,"_53":307,"_55":19,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":211,"_61":1299,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":50,"_51":209,"_53":210,"_55":33,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":202,"_61":1294,"_55":204,"_57":-7},{"_49":59,"_51":195,"_61":1286,"_55":197,"_57":-7},{"_49":190,"_55":191,"_51":192,"_61":1284},{"_49":180,"_55":115,"_51":1280,"_72":1281,"_82":1282,"_33":1283,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_56":291},{"_49":50,"_55":177,"_51":178,"_53":179},"Inside th